{"id": "16-1514-2-4", "zh": "isa：意为“寻求”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1514-5-6", "zh": "esati（寻求）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1514-7-8", "zh": "isi（仙人）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1515-2-15", "zh": "这里，因为他们寻求戒等功德，所以称为 isi（仙人），指诸佛等圣者，以及以苦行者的出家方式出家的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1515-16-28", "zh": "“isi、tāpasa、jaṭila、jaṭī、jaṭādhara”，这些都是苦行者的同义词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1516-2-4", "zh": "kasa：意为“犁耕、划开”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1516-5-8", "zh": "kasati、kassati（耕）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1516-9-12", "zh": "kassaka（农夫）、ākāsa（虚空）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1517-2-6", "zh": "这里，**kassako** 是指种田的人。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1517-7-10", "zh": "**ākāso** 是指天空。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1517-11-15", "zh": "因为它不能被犁耕，所以称为 ākāsa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1517-16-21", "zh": "意思是没有办法耕它、划开它。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1517-22-24", "zh": "以下是它的同义名称——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1518-2-10", "zh": "ākāsa、ambara、abbha、antalikkha、agha、nabha，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1519-2-10", "zh": "vehāsa、gagana、deva、kha，还有 ādiccapatha，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1520-2-7", "zh": "tārāpatha、nakkhattapatha，还有 ravipatha，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1521-2-7", "zh": "vehāyasa、vāyupatha、apatha、anilañjasa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1522-2-13", "zh": "kasa、sisa、jasa、jhasa、vasa、masa、disa、jusa、yusa：意为“伤害”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1522-14-15", "zh": "kasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-16-17", "zh": "sisati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-18-19", "zh": "jasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-20-21", "zh": "jhasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-22-23", "zh": "vasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-24-25", "zh": "masati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-26-27", "zh": "masaka（蚊子）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1522-28-31", "zh": "omasati、omasavāda。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-32-33", "zh": "disati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-34-35", "zh": "jusati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1522-36-37", "zh": "yūsati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1523-2-6", "zh": "其中，**omasati** 是指刺。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1523-7-13", "zh": "**omasavādo** 是指像用针一样刺伤别人的话。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1523-14-17", "zh": "**masako** 就是 makasa（蚊子）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1524-2-4", "zh": "bhassa：意为“说话”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1524-5-14", "zh": "bhassa 是指言谈，就像在“住处、行处、言谈、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1524-15-20", "zh": "说话者”等句中那样。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1524-21-22", "zh": "bhassati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1524-23-24", "zh": "bhaṭṭha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1524-25-31", "zh": "bhaṭṭha 是指所说的，意思是话语。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1524-32-34", "zh": "不过这里——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1525-2-10", "zh": "“大牟尼啊，您的偈颂说得很好，富有意义；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1526-2-11", "zh": "我被您的善说所说服，请您成为我的皈依。”", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1527-2-4", "zh": "这是圣典中的例证。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1527-5-12", "zh": "其中，**nijjhatto** 是指被说服，也就是凭着法的力量与智慧而得到开解的我。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1527-13-16", "zh": "**subhaṭṭhena** 就是“以善说”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1528-2-8", "zh": "jisu、nisu、visu、misu、vassa：意为“洒水”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1528-9-10", "zh": "jesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1528-11-12", "zh": "nesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1528-13-14", "zh": "vesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1528-15-16", "zh": "mesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1528-17-19", "zh": "天下雨（devo vassati）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1529-2-5", "zh": "marisu：也意为“忍受”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1529-6-9", "zh": "ca 字表示同时兼有“洒水”之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1529-10-11", "zh": "marisati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1530-2-4", "zh": "pusa：意为“养育”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1530-5-6", "zh": "posati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1530-7-8", "zh": "posa（人）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1530-9-12", "zh": "因为人由业、心、时节、食物所滋养，所以称为 posa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1530-13-28", "zh": "不过，由于见到“天也滋养其他众生”这样的用例，我们在 cur 等动词类中也会讲到这个词根。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1531-2-8", "zh": "pisu、silisu、pusu、palusu、usu：意为“燃烧”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1531-9-10", "zh": "pesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1531-11-12", "zh": "silesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1531-13-14", "zh": "silesa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1531-15-16", "zh": "posati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1531-17-18", "zh": "palosati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1531-19-20", "zh": "osati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1531-21-22", "zh": "usu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1532-2-4", "zh": "ghasu：意为“摩擦”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1532-5-7", "zh": "saṃharisa 就是碰撞、摩擦。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1532-8-9", "zh": "ghassati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1533-2-4", "zh": "hasu：意为“拥抱”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1533-5-7", "zh": "āliṅga 就是搂抱。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1533-8-9", "zh": "hassati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1534-2-5", "zh": "hasa：意为“笑”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1534-6-7", "zh": "hasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1534-8-17", "zh": "马嘶鸣，骏马嘶鸣；pahasati、uhasati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1534-18-37", "zh": "在使役形中有“hāseti”等，还有 uhasiyamāna、hāsa、pahāsa、hasana、pahasana、hasita。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1534-38-55", "zh": "去掉 ha 字后，微笑称为“sita”，例如在“现出微笑”等句中。", "confidence": 80}
